        "tags": [
          "Payments V2 API (CA Interac, EU TARGET2, FX Wire, MX SPEI, PayPal, SEPA Credit Transfer, SEPA Instant, U.S. ACH Credit Transfer, U.S. Domestic Wire, U.S. Foreign Wire, U.S. Real Time Payment, and Zelle)"
